/erl-entrance env_0030_money_transfer_service N=5 M=2 — Customer care of an international money transfer service (B2C, small business): senders hold accounts with tiered limits and recipients by corridor, booking transfers, fees and exchange rates, cancellations and refunds, holds and verification, failed deliveries and limit increases. Prioritize the realism of the scenario when generating the environment, tasks, and documents: everything, especially the associated settings of prerequisite tasks, must conform to real-world scenarios and existing logic rather than being fabricated. Output folder: env/env_0030_money_transfer_service. This is an unattended run: never ask questions or wait for confirmation.
